{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "08979909067e9b35e3f7a8ee04180a4ccef736bdc89380fcf22c1b16b783c088", "ja": "わたしのドキドキが伝わるように", "zh": "希望能传达我心中的悸动", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d62c4c786a7de0fd4ed6282931dfe71cdc4e7ef448e960e7addb78288e7706bb", "ja": "番組で動物コーナーを担当することになり、\n動画で予習をする星梨花。プロデューサー\nとの会話の中で、無理に流行の言葉を使う\nより、感じた気持ちをそのまま伝えること\nがなにより大事であることに気付く。", "zh": "因为要在节目中负责动物环节，\n星梨花通过观看视频提前学习。在与制作人\n的交谈中，她意识到，比起勉强使用流行用语，\n最重要的是将自己的真实感受直接传达出去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1000_null", "source_sha256": "e83a2340fc1b0e468bedeb79eaed8784b1bf302023c4aadb6c68ab7d53be1a3f", "ja": "各担当コーナーが決定した翌日……", "zh": "各自负责的板块确定后的第二天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1001_null", "source_sha256": "ea2f50b6f094ceb50940a0f6b189078679a38b307d43133386826cd9a2c28d6b", "ja": "モォ～～～！！", "zh": "哞～～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1002_401pro", "source_sha256": "ff2e85826d976fdb3c3da6529bdcf4fccd3c78a4cde856858f91459fcd51caa0", "ja": "へ？　これは……、\n牛の声？　なんで控え室から？", "zh": "咦？这是……  \n牛的叫声？怎么会从休息室传出来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "a0299fb48c8f29b9f455dd0fd681a7bb059d5d5f513bc11509f76e496925a467", "ja": "わぁ、かわいい……♪\n……あ。ダメ、ちゃんとお勉強しないと……。", "zh": "哇，好可爱……♪\n……啊。不行，我得好好学习才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1004_401pro", "source_sha256": "c99d0a98e5e8081089b305ba0d2077aba25cd8199c6331c340efc0a8cd956ffb", "ja": "星梨花？　お疲れさま。\nどうして牛の声が……あ、動画を見てたのか？", "zh": "星梨花？辛苦了。\n怎么会有牛叫声……啊，原来是在看视频吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "bfca793d3409497d37371b14a4fb9427d76e6a331e326f9679209965ebc7a4e2", "ja": "プロデューサーさん！\nはい、番組のお仕事に備えて、予習をしてました。", "zh": "制作人先生！\n嗯，为了准备节目的工作，我提前做了功课。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1006_401pro", "source_sha256": "98e0e793697f237fe0f8d003d076e0d5bb0f88f9bf4094596f6e77be88a31771", "ja": "そっか、星梨花は動物コーナーの担当になったからな。\n……でも、なんで牛なんだ？", "zh": "这样啊，星梨花负责动物环节了。\n……不过，为什么是牛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "b9cb1a91ff973a2983ed6d0f1332561d0c12cd9e1f806cf6facac1468049c180", "ja": "この牛さんは、前に番組で紹介された子なんです。\nほかにも、ニワトリさんとか、お魚さんとか……。", "zh": "这头牛是之前在节目中介绍过的孩子。\n还有小鸡、小鱼什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "4bd43701b45450995622cd4b08ab330d0fe8ada15b478b26f8811b746d103e1f", "ja": "本当にいろんな動物が出るみたいだから、どんな子が\n来てもちゃんと紹介できるように、と思って。", "zh": "听说真的会有各种各样的动物出现，所以我想着，不管来的是怎样的动物，都要能够好好介绍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1009_401pro", "source_sha256": "ddda27b054c4f74d4f05c2ccc7d4b626c68c21d662d89e6501310f6c7e718d30", "ja": "なるほど。\n星梨花は勉強熱心なんだな。", "zh": "原来如此。\n星梨花还真是热爱学习啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "bc7aea3dc9cd927333baa1e1dfc4a03c6742cacf17bcb0e3a11b312eab750eb8", "ja": "えへへ。コメントもいろいろ覚えたんですよ！\n「この牛さんきゃわたん♪」とか「好」とか……。", "zh": "嘿嘿。我还学会了好多种评论呢！\n比如“这头牛好可爱♪”或者“好”之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "eb7e446d4a5482a4433ef4fa619706ce8be1c627cb53e5dae34786eaeb42cc87", "ja": "あと「かわいすぎてしんどい」とか！\nみなさんのコメント、どれも面白くて勉強になります♪", "zh": "还有“可爱到犯规”之类的！\n大家的留言都很有意思，让我学到了好多♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1012_401pro", "source_sha256": "a223ec44810d6ffac51bebe56d212405335b02c71b1d90782b842083d5a6caef", "ja": "ははっ、流行語みたいなものだからな。\n確かにそういう言葉を使うのも面白いけど……。", "zh": "哈哈，毕竟算是流行语之类的嘛。确实，用那种说法也挺有意思，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1013_401pro", "source_sha256": "06716cf884887b442dbe135df407fd28fe6948ed1b95fb48a94c8e1a9e6b7c49", "ja": "でも、無理して使うこともないんだぞ？", "zh": "不过，也没必要勉强自己去用吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "01acaddd4069b7919003b1f7fcf8cca961565a18ced7a390983a29ac465214f3", "ja": "え？　そうなんですか？", "zh": "诶？是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1015_401pro", "source_sha256": "b8c591c5d96f790947bbf9e700c6b2b9da31500ba2204015465981e63852ab90", "ja": "うん。スポットだけど、今回は他の誰かじゃなくて、\n星梨花が動物コーナーの担当リポーターなんだ。", "zh": "嗯。虽然只是个短节目，但这次不是由别人，而是由星梨花担任动物栏目的负责记者。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1016_401pro", "source_sha256": "a2f6cd568b37bb35b4a41293d331ce7af799090c9d1c3a9af31e4f7612993517", "ja": "コーナーの担当として、胸を張って、\n自分の言葉でリポートしてもいいんじゃないかな？", "zh": "作为这个环节的负责人，堂堂正正地用自己的话来报道，不也很好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "4827e97c20e07e91898d1ea6fbfaf13c3dfa26784d2a7f1119d55e9927df354f", "ja": "わたしの言葉で……。", "zh": "用我的话……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1018_401pro", "source_sha256": "17d263a71d6551ec6770ce7837f0770710092825480eee3a0095c8d648e76815", "ja": "……例えばさっきの牛の動画を見て、\n星梨花はどう思ったんだ？", "zh": "……比如看了刚才牛的视频，\n星梨花是怎么想的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "b9c722a604cf3d35c8338fe8b0f2afbd610933fa5a8b061ecef5bbb1d3954b79", "ja": "えっと……「かわいい」って思いました。\nでも、それだと普通ですよね……？", "zh": "那个……我觉得“很可爱”。\n不过，这样的感想很普通吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1020_401pro", "source_sha256": "0231b0b4ac924b3e93c63c2abea970ec885073fccfdff640365a325da09520be", "ja": "なるほど……。じゃあ、もう少し考えてみようか。\nどんなところがかわいかったのかな？", "zh": "原来如此……那我们再稍微想想看吧。\n到底是哪些地方可爱呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "94ae373c02ba97f97c533e5c528545faec3abff3749877de8eedde690a499a43", "ja": "えっと……牛さんなのに、そんなに大きくなくて。\n足も細くて、顔もまだ赤ちゃんみたいなところとか……", "zh": "那个……明明是头牛，却没有那么大。\n腿也很细，脸也还像小宝宝一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "b6fb168b9ac2250c9da87fdfebd7627e29198dcadcc0f01734a60c8c6d81830a", "ja": "あと、とっても素直な子なんです！　ご飯だよって\n呼ばれたら、すぐ走ってきて、頭をスリスリして……", "zh": "而且，它还是个特别听话的孩子！一被叫\n开饭了，就会马上跑过来蹭脑袋……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "71c7781e710e853ca49257785e0440197b47d7faadcf36ca270858a22bb34223", "ja": "なんだか、ちょっと大きなジュニオールみたいでした。\nそれで、ますますかわいくなって……。", "zh": "总觉得它有点像长大版的朱尼奥尔。\n所以就变得越来越可爱了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1024_401pro", "source_sha256": "9960271a2a52643913642acd0b5fa3d942fe6892c8313ec3d8bd721f4bf611bc", "ja": "うん、すごくいいと思う！　動画を見てない俺にも、\n牛がどうかわいかったか、ちゃんと伝わって来たよ！", "zh": "嗯，我觉得非常棒！即使是没看视频的我，也能清楚感受到那头牛有多可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1025_022ser", "source_sha256": "cfda794ea8d74c53d95def98cecaba9b985c4eae4b7c8ff3d2409b5904cd7ea4", "ja": "！　本当ですか？\nわたしの言葉で、ちゃんとリポートできてましたか？", "zh": "真的吗？我用自己的话，好好完成报道了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1026_401pro", "source_sha256": "dd4a498978b2d46a2d48fc5dab0cb4aba6ae26822d50dbce7f98aa33a4a7a7df", "ja": "バッチリだ。きっと星梨花がドキドキしたことを、\nそのまま伝えてくれたおかげかな。", "zh": "非常棒。多亏了你把星梨花当时怦怦直跳的感觉原原本本地传达了出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "a414a8367698b53db86b206046c057f4f285296275751e6a59cd116eaf3aa28c", "ja": "ドキドキを、そのまま……。", "zh": "把这份悸动，就这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1028_401pro", "source_sha256": "5a4f9ac72c5aef271fb541038b3808875f86e0b21b5cd28efd7c0d5561efd0b6", "ja": "本番でも今みたいに、星梨花が見つけたこと、ドキドキ\nしたことを、星梨花の言葉で伝えていいと思う。", "zh": "正式演出时也可以像现在这样，把星梨花发现的事、心动\n的感受，用星梨花自己的话传达出来，我觉得这样就很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1029_401pro", "source_sha256": "87ba6e041068da1492891d2a4e4782e04d4d0848a5b0ab44d982a3fee3217fcf", "ja": "その方が星梨花の気持ちは、絶対伝わるから。\n……星梨花の、ときめきと一緒に！", "zh": "这样才能绝对把星梨花的心情传达出去。\n……连同星梨花的心动一起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1031_022ser", "source_sha256": "706dadfed10594ab64644bb1813e3d9fdb6f96338a0e4498676bda92f2da0979", "ja": "ありがとうございます、プロデューサーさん。\nわたし、やってみますね。", "zh": "谢谢您，制作人。\n我会试着做做看的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1032_022ser", "source_sha256": "8c1b740d2446fee4ede2847c009d049740fd4e9ef9df0f79140d15988a852eff", "ja": "ドキドキを、わたしの言葉で……。\nそれなら、きっとできると思います。だって……。", "zh": "用我的话语，表达这份心跳不已……  \n这样的话，我一定能做到。因为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0318_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0318_story_01_1033_022ser", "source_sha256": "ed7c0d44312ffed485c2f79d4857a3c5dfdda426a0bb64dfbd017297c6af5ec8", "ja": "わたし、アイドルになってからずっと、\n毎日ドキドキしてますから！　……えへへ♪", "zh": "我自从成为偶像以来，每天都心跳不已！……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
